<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-043" chapter-id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin" source-id="s-liangshu-043-weichan-kin-ws2087360">
  <p id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p001:m0000" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA">韋粲</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p001:m0003" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA">長蒨</persName>，車騎將軍<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p001:m0010" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AA">叡</persName>之孫，北徐州刺史<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p001:m0019" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAA">放</persName>之子也。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002:m0000" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA">粲</persName>子<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002:m0002" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAAB">尼</persName>及三弟<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002:m0006" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAB">助</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002:m0008" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAC">警</persName>、<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002:m0010" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAD">構</persName>、從弟<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p002:m0014" ref="spa_2ae_p2l">昂</persName>皆戰死，親戚死者數百人。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p003" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p003:m0000" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAA">粲</persName>長子<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p003:m0003" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAAA">臧</persName>，字<persName id="c-liangshu-043-weichan-kin:p003:m0006" ref="axs_5y7_p7w_AAAAA">君理</persName>。</p>
</text>
